    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "18dc6458a34d1451aefb": "Ye know more than I do, that's a certainty. Tell ye what though, go talk with me da'. He'll want ye ta prove yerself, but he is a fine teacher indeed. His name's Rotgath, and ye'll find him near the anvils workin steel for ol' Bengus.",
        "37b249454576b9644073": "Ye've got a little skill on ye. Enough to learn ye a few things I wager. Let's see what I can teach ye, shall we?",
        "3ca60d825ba3089cd7e6": "Train me.",
        "6e2b8cbc3dac58912380": "Eh? I don't have time ta chat, my da' wants me ta finish this order fer him."
      },
      "name": "Groum Stonebeard",
      "subName": "Journeyman Blacksmith",
      "translationMetadata": {
